WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.523
Bird flew up to Kip's hole.

2
00:00:10.524 --> 00:00:16.065
"Are you okay?" asked Bird.

3
00:00:16.066 --> 00:00:24.264
"I was reading a scary book," said Kip.

4
00:00:24.265 --> 00:00:28.491
"It’s the middle of the night," said Bird.

5
00:00:28.492 --> 00:00:31.977
"Why are you awake?"

6
00:00:31.978 --> 00:00:36.289
"I'm staying up all night," said Kip.

7
00:00:36.290 --> 00:00:40.364
"Have fun," said Bird.

8
00:00:40.365 --> 00:00:46.417
"I'm going back to sleep."

9
00:00:46.418 --> 00:00:52.231
Bird flew down to her nest.

10
00:00:52.232 --> 00:00:59.516
She went to sleep.

11
00:00:59.517 --> 00:01:01.592
"Bird!" called Kip.

12
00:01:01.593 --> 00:01:04.456
"What?" asked Bird.

13
00:01:04.457 --> 00:01:07.425
"I'm still scared," said Kip.

14
00:01:07.426 --> 00:01:13.643
"That book was really scary."

15
00:01:13.644 --> 00:01:19.081
"There's nothing to be scared of," said Bird.

16
00:01:19.082 --> 00:01:22.890
"Can you stay up with me?" asked Kip.

17
00:01:22.891 --> 00:01:32.027
"No," said Bird. "I'm tired.

18
00:01:32.028 --> 00:01:34.682
Read a funny book.

19
00:01:34.683 --> 00:01:46.476
Then you won't be scared."

20
00:01:46.477 --> 00:01:50.606
Bird went to sleep.

21
00:01:50.607 --> 00:02:02.737
Kip found a funny book.

22
00:02:02.738 --> 00:02:06.042
He sat down.

23
00:02:06.043 --> 00:02:12.022
He ate some popcorn.

24
00:02:12.023 --> 00:02:17.281
Kip opened the book.

25
00:02:17.282 --> 00:02:23.483
"Ha-ha!" Kip laughed. "Ha-ha!"

26
00:02:23.484 --> 00:02:31.355
Bird woke up again.

